<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5067] Absolute swapFilePath for MemoryPolicy is merged incorrectly with working dir path</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5067</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Stepstoreproduce&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Steps to reproduce&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create &lt;b&gt;MemoryPolicyConfiguration&lt;/b&gt; with swapFilePath specified to some &lt;b&gt;absolute&lt;/b&gt; path&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start Ignite node with this configuration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Expectedoutcome&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Expected outcome&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Swap file is allocated by absolute path specified by configuration.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Actualoutcome&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Actual outcome&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Swap file is allocated by path where current working directory is merged with swapFilePath.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
